## Resolved findings

| ID | Severity | Fix | Test |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| ADV-P3-01 | blocking | `src/storytime/muse-delivery.ts:340-345` refuses a duplicate `row.id` in `options.rows` before any write. | ADV9 at `tests/storytime-muse-delivery-adversarial.test.ts:567` passes. |
| ADV-P3-NB1 | nonblocking | `src/storytime/muse-delivery.ts:347-350` refuses a delivery root that is a symlink. | ADV13 at `tests/storytime-muse-delivery-adversarial.test.ts:663` passes. |

Both guards run before any read of a Muse print and before the first write.

## Probes and results

| ID | Probe | Result |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ADV1 | an entry that points at another row's print of the same size class | pass. The writer copies the named print, and the two rows never swap bytes. |
| ADV2 | another row's print of the other format in the color field and in the line field | pass. Both are refused with the row id, and both targets stay empty. |
| ADV3 | a line print with one pixel at 254, 128, or 1, and a pure 0/255 control | pass. Each value is refused as one grey pixel. The control delivers. |
| ADV4 | a color print with alpha, and a JPEG under a .png name | pass. Both are refused, and both targets stay empty. |
| ADV5 | one changed character in manifest.json | pass. The run is refused and the folder stays byte-identical. |
| ADV6 | a different file, or a folder, under a delivered name | pass. Both are refused and the folder stays byte-identical. |
| ADV7 | a week 3 entry in a `deliver --week 2` run over a populated folder | pass. Exit 1, and the week 2 delivery stays byte-identical. |
| ADV8 | the same row id twice in the approval list | pass. The run is refused before any write. |
| ADV9 | the same row id twice in the picture list | pass. The run is refused before any write. |
| ADV10 | `fileVersion` on a line name with no -v<n>.png suffix | pass. The run is refused before any read. Closes the RA-P3V2-1 test gap. |
| ADV11 | `fileVersion` 1e21, with a fileVersion 2 control | pass. 1e21 is refused by the safe-integer bound. |
| ADV12 | a symlink at a delivered name whose bytes match | pass. The run is refused and the link stays a link. |
| ADV13 | a symlinked delivery root | pass. The run is refused, no byte goes through the link, and the link stays. The control writes three files into a real folder. |

## ADV13 fails without the guard

The probe at 87ca5dab ran the same fixture with a symlinked delivery root. The writer then wrote
3 files through the link and returned a manifest. That behavior is recorded as ADV-P3-NB1 in
`adversarial-87ca5dab.json`. With that behavior, the rejection assertion of ADV13 fails. So ADV13
fails when the guard at `src/storytime/muse-delivery.ts:347-350` is absent.

## Notes

- The symlink guard checks the delivery root itself with lstat. It does not resolve parent
  components. A parent folder symlink stays outside the guard. This run records no finding for it,
  because the operator names the delivery path and no spec rule covers a parent link.
- ADV1 records that the writer copies the print that the approval entry names. No spec or plan
  rule asks it to check the row id inside the Muse file name.
- The role changed no production file. `git diff b661e01f..21de99f6` for `src/` and `scripts/` is
  empty.
- The result files are not committed, per the run order.

